2. Definitions.— In this Ordinance, unless there is anything repugnant in the subject or context,—
(a) “Chairman” means Chairman of the Commission;
(b) “Commission” means the Commission established under section 3;
(c) “Fund” means Access to Justice Development Fund established under section 6-A; and
(d) “member” means member of the Commission.

3. Composition of Commission.— (1) There shall be a Law and Justice Commission of Pakistan consisting of—
(a) the Chief Justice of Pakistan who shall be the Chairman, ex-officio;
(b) the Chief Justice of the Federal Shariat Court, Member, ex-officio;
(c) the Chief Justices of the High Courts, Members, ex-officio;

(d) Attorney General for Pakistan, Member, ex-officio;

